{
  "title": "Hirz-e-Imam al-Mahdi (a.t.f.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "This evil-repelling prayer is ascribed to our master the Rising Imam al-Mahdi (a.t.f.s.):\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah; the All-beneficent, the All-merciful.\nيَا مَالِكَ الرِّقَابِ وَ يَا هَازِمَ الْاَحْزَابِ\nYAA MAALEKAR REQAABE WA YAA HAAZEMAL AHZAABE\nO owner of all selves! O defeater of the allies!\nيَا مُفَتِّحَ الْاَبْوَابِ يَا مُسَبِّبَ الْاَسْبَابِ\nYAA MOFATTEHAL ABWAABE YAA MOSABBEBAL ASBAABE\nO opener of all doors! O creator of all causes!\nسَبِّبْ لَنَا سَبَبًا لَّا نَسْتَطِيْعُ لَهٗ طَلَبًا\nSABBIB LANAA SABABAL LAA NASTATEE-O’ LAHU TALABAN \nFacilitate for us a means [and opening] that we could not have ever sought or attained on our own, \nبِحَقِّ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ مُحَمَّدٌ رَّسُوْلُ اللهِ\nBE-HAQQE LAAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHO MOHAMMADUR RASOOLUL LAAHE \nby the right of 'There is no god but Allah, Muhammad is the Messenger of Allah'\nصَلَّى اللهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ عَلٰى اٰلِهٖ اَجْمَعِيْنَ.\nSALLAL LAAHO A’LAYHE WA A’LAA AALEHI AJMAE’EN.\nmay the blessings of Allah be upon him and upon all of his family."
}
